## Metadata
Author: Mrs. M. B. Wood
Copyright: New York World
Date: 1914-02-08
Number: 8
Notes: A 13-wide diamond with a shaded cross in the centre printed "No 8" (shown as _); two words, 33-34 and 35-36, run down the centre column above and below the cross. The number is printed in the centre block; the intro calls it "the eighth in FUN'S series". Credit, in the intro: "has been contributed by Mrs. M. B. Wood of New York City." Read by hand from the Milwaukee Sentinel's page (Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_08_80.png), solution from Milwaukee_Sentinel_1914_02_15_84.png, by Claude, 2026-11-16.


